<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs Steady/off $.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs Steady/off $.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts: Steady to $.50 lower. Demand moderate on a light to moderate movement. Top $60.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs. 58.50-59.50 Few 58.00 &amp; 60.00</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs. 53.00-58.00</p>
<p>	  210-230 lbs. 48.50-53.00</p>
<p>Sows: Steady to Weak. Top 49.00</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-500 lbs. 43.00-45.50</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 46.00-48.00</p>
<p>few over 600 lbs  48.00-49.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
